<title>CHINA: Wah Ha Realty year net rises 94 pct.</title>
<headline>Wah Ha Realty year net rises 94 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   41.8  vs 21.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    5.0   vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    50.49 vs 26.07</p>
<p>    Turnover		     15.30 vs 13.35</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wah Ha Realty Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 10-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 29</p>
<p>NOTE - Wah Ha Realty engages in investment holding, property investment and development.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is eight H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of three cents) vs seven cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
